  HolMultiLib.Metric's dependencies from Session, SessionMultiLib.Misc and
  SessionLibrary (Card, Floor, Wo, Products, Iter), and exports every
  theorem, tactic and conversion by name.  Importing this module is
  `needs "Multivariate/metric.ml"`: its own `needs` are the imports below,
  and each bundle is built by `initialize` when the module is loaded, in
  file order.
-/

